<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC talks will be over Thursday - UAE.</title>
<headline>OPEC talks will be over Thursday - UAE.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC will finish their meeting on Thursday, acting UAE oil minister Rakad bin Salem bin Rakad said after Wednesday's session.</p>
<p>He added that Thursday's talks will also be a closed session.</p>
<p>Indonesian oil minister Ida Bagus Sudjana said that OPEC would discuss production at Thursday's session.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
